#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:615
msgid "How do I display an ad?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:616
msgid ""
"Create an ad under WB Ad Manager > Add New, select a placement (header, "
"footer, sidebar, before/after content), and publish. The ad appears "
"automatically in that position on your site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:620
msgid "Can I show different ads on different pages?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:621
msgid ""
"Yes. Use the Display Rules box when editing an ad. You can target specific "
"pages, categories, post types, or user roles."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:625
msgid "What ad types are supported?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:626
msgid ""
"Five ad types: Image (with click URL and alt text), Rich Content "
"(HTML-editor), HTML/JavaScript Code, Google AdSense, and Email Capture "
"(inline newsletter form)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:630
msgid "How does the Email Capture ad type work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:631
msgid ""
"Email Capture renders an inline subscribe form anywhere you assign it as a "
"placement. You control the headline, description, button text, colours, and "
"success message. Submissions fire the wbam_email_captured action so you can "
"forward them to Mailchimp, ConvertKit, or any webhook. There's no external "
"service tie-in."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:635
msgid "Can I accept partnership / paid link inquiries from my site?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:636
msgid ""
"Yes. Drop [wbam_partnership_inquiry] on any page. Visitors fill out a "
"structured form (partnership type, budget, target page, anchor text). "
"Inquiries appear under WB Ad Manager → Link Partnerships with accept / "
"reject workflow and automatic email notifications."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:642
msgid "How do cloaked links work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:643
msgid ""
"Cloaked links redirect visitors through your domain (e.g., "
"yoursite.com/go/amazon) to the destination URL. This makes links cleaner "
"and enables click tracking."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:647
msgid "My cloaked links show a 404 page. How do I fix this?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:648
msgid ""
"Go to Settings > Permalinks and click \"Save Changes\" to flush the rewrite "
"rules. This resolves the issue."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:652
msgid "Classifieds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:655
msgid "How do users post classifieds?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:656
msgid ""
"Users visit the Advertiser Dashboard page and use the Classifieds tab to "
"submit listings. The multi-step wizard guides them through title, "
"description, images, category, price, and contact info. Listings can "
"require admin approval before going live."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:660
msgid "How does the credit/wallet system work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:661
msgid ""
"Advertisers purchase credits which are used to pay for ad submissions, "
"classified listings, and upgrades. Credits are held when a listing is "
"submitted and deducted when approved (or refunded if rejected). Configure "
"payment methods in Settings > Credits."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:665
msgid "Where is the Advertiser Dashboard?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:667
msgid ""
"The dashboard is created automatically on plugin activation. You can find "
"or reassign it in"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:668
msgid "Settings > General > Pages"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:672
msgid "Demo Data"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:675
msgid "How do I import demo data?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:677
msgid "Go to"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:678
msgid "WB Ad Manager > Tools"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:679
msgid ""
"and click \"Import Demo Data\". This creates sample ads, classifieds, "
"advertisers, campaigns, and 30 days of analytics."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:684
msgid "How do I remove demo data?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/class-help-docs.php:685
msgid ""
"After importing, the Tools page shows a \"Remove All Demo Data\" button "
"with an itemized list of what will be deleted. Your real content is never "
"touched. Every item is verified against the demo flag before removal."
msgstr ""

